  "ingredients": [
    "4 large eggs",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup vegetable oil",
    "1 (15 ounce) can pumpkin purée",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.75 teaspoon salt",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "1 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "4 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground cinnamon, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a large sheet pan, line with parchment paper, and grease the paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4UT458VhU3gQWW8DLHNiCatLvD8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229508-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-frosting-step-01-4x3-8f1f501425bc4af0b2628ad6b435a25f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229508/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat eggs in a large bowl with an electric hand mixer until foamy. Add white sugar, oil, and pumpkin puree; beat on medium speed until well combined, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tAN8KbDY02e6zQQve_v90Wut8PI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229508-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-frosting-steps-03-4x3-045102507e144ba6b17ad9832ed2b431.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229508/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix flour, baking powder, cinnamon, baking soda, and salt together in a separate bowl. Beat flour mixture into egg mixture on low speed until just combined, about 1 minute. Pour batter evenly into the prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sanlGWi4_MVqFKDjCiXPp1gE6vc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229508-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-frosting-step-06-4x3-7181cd12232948d5a6d91b7e58687f71.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229508/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted in the center comes out clean, about 25 minutes. Cool cake completely, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i3jZPjI_nzRhtAd2seHfn3cK7Ac=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229508-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-frosting-step-07-4x3-086dbb69bb8a4578b8b923514304470d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229508/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat cream cheese, butter, and vanilla extract in a bowl with an electric mixer until creamy. Gradually mix in confectioners' sugar until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SpWBqTaZLCbmNpcdRy-DAaxWX34=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229508-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-frosting-step-08-4x3-aadf8799877c45109354611e519ab4de.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229508/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread frosting evenly over cake; sprinkle with cinnamon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YE4Y5vGo65JeEUOL-ia3ORX-EU8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229508-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-frosting-step-09-4x3-c73838c741f640efaff32cbe385fd79e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229508/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut into 24 bars.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4uM-vUWmYBp1yopRIUK-037wkyo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229508-pumpkin-bars-with-cream-cheese-frosting-DDMFS-4x3-0651872d736240538f9ff6efa82d3421.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229508/step_07.webp"
    }
